# Playwright probe artefacts. The verify_*/shoot_* scripts write a temporary
# route under app/um-probe-* before their build and delete it on exit; if a run
# is killed mid-flight the directory survives and must never be committed. Their
# screenshots land in scratch-shots-*/ for the same reason.
app/um-probe-*/
scratch-shots-*/
scratch-shots/

# Playwright authentication state. The curriculum harness signs in once through
# the real Google flow and saves the resulting COOKIES here (app/lib/supabase-
# server.ts uses @supabase/ssr, so the session is cookie-borne). This file is a
# live session for a real account and must never be committed. Ignored BEFORE
# anything writes into the directory, deliberately.
.auth/

# Harness output: rendered before/after captures from scripts/verify_teacher_shell.mjs.
.shell-snapshots/
